  "require_parameters_rationale": "true: the Anthropic endpoint lists every parameter the judge sends (max_tokens, reasoning and, when requested, response_format), so the router fails a request it cannot honor instead of silently dropping a setting; sampling parameters are never sent",
  "reservation_rule": "prompt bound = UTF-8 bytes of the serialized request + framing allowance (capped at the context), priced at the highest prompt price among reachable tiers (cache-write price too when prompt caching is enabled), plus max_tokens at the highest reachable completion price; no cache discount",
  "all_required_passed": true
